<title>USA: Brightpoint sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Tuesday it declared a five-for-four stock split to be effected in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on March 3 to holders of record of its common stock on February 11.  The &quot;ex-dividend&quot; date for Brightpoint common stock will be March 4, 1997.</p>
<p>Brightpoint distributes wireless communications equipment and provides related products and services.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
